    <title type="sort">2. Tabellnavigering</title>
    <title type="link">Tabellnavigering</title>
    <desc>Konfigurerer <app>Orca</app> si navigering i tabellar</desc>
    <credit type="author">
      <name>Joanmarie Diggs</name>
